            "remarks": "If this is true, an empty type is allowed and type as child of anyOf is permitted if following one of the following patterns:

1) anyOf:
- type: integer
- type: string
2) allOf:
- anyOf:
- type: integer
- type: string
- ... zero or more",
            "summary": "x-kubernetes-int-or-string specifies that this value is either an integer or a string.",
