        "custom": {
          "schema": "io.k8s.api.apps.v1beta2.StatefulSet",
        },
        "remarks": "See the release notes for more information. StatefulSet represents a set of pods with consistent identities. Identities are defined as:
- Network: A single stable DNS and hostname.
- Storage: As many VolumeClaims as requested.
The StatefulSet guarantees that a given network identity will always map to the same storage identity.",
        "summary": "DEPRECATED - This group version of StatefulSet is deprecated by apps/v1/StatefulSet.",
      },
