            },
            "remarks": "The custom resources are served under \`/apis/<group>/<version>/...\`. Must match the name of the first item in the \`versions\` list if \`version\` and \`versions\` are both specified. Optional if \`versions\` is specified. Deprecated: use \`versions\` instead.",
